    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17504" root="زجل" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَاجِلٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَجِلٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It is also applied to a song,
or singing, [meaning <i>Loud,</i>] in the saying,
“<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهُوَ يُغَنِّيهَا غِنَآءً زَاجِلَا</span><br />
”
[<i>And he sings to her,</i> or <i>to them</i> (probably referring to camels), <i>with a loud song</i> or <i>singing</i>].
(TA.)

